Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Run a step's attempts

---
 src/recipe.mjs             |  6 ++++++
 src/retry.mjs              |  4 ++++
 src/run-step.mjs           | 11 +++++++++++
 test/helpers/fake-step.mjs |  5 +++++
 test/run-step.test.mjs     | 24 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 50 insertions(+)
